# tunnel-silence-records: RECORDS screen for SILENCE, dwelling over its course flyby.
# Silence carries three consecutive TRACK_SHAPE_TUNNEL control points (fzx_course.h:311-318);
# the flyby runs the whole lap, so the enclosed tunnel interior is drawn several times.
# SHOT PLACEMENT IS NOT AUTHORED HERE ANY MORE (NEXT.md B15/B43, coverage2-progress.md).
# This file is the INPUT script: ticks, buttons, sticks. The schedule that decides which frames
# the parity gate hashes is DERIVED from a `[debug] cov=1` coverage census of the replay and
# written into the .gdxrec by tools/dev/covsched.py. Regenerating a .gdxrec from this file
# therefore produces a recording with NO SHOTs; re-apply the schedule with
#   tools/dev/covsched.py derive <cov-run>/log-*.txt --rewrite in.gdxrec out.gdxrec
# The hand-placed schedules this file used to carry covered 49-80% of what their replay draws.
build native/replays@d45fe63
seed1 0x1234abcd
seed2 0x0fedcba9
pins renderthread=0 rival_detail_auto=0 stereo=1 fh_every=0
at 400
press START 15 0
at 660
press RIGHT 12 0
at 760
press A 12 0
at 860
press DOWN 12 0
at 960
press A 12 0
at 1160
press A 12 0
at 1320
press RIGHT 12 0
at 1440
press A 12 0
at 1620
press A 12 0
at 1800
wait 70
wait 70
wait 70
wait 70
wait 70
wait 70
wait 70
wait 70
wait 70
wait 70
wait 70
wait 70
wait 70
wait 70
wait 70
wait 70
wait 70
wait 70
wait 70
wait 70
wait 70
wait 70
wait 70
wait 70
wait 70
wait 70
wait 70
wait 70
wait 70
